      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">What is VUE SALON all about?â€¨A client-first unisex salon offering honest consultations, professional services, and transparent pricing. Do you offer pricing before the service?â€¨Yes, all service pricing is clearly explained before starting any treatment. Can I say no to a service after the consultation?â€¨Yes, consultations are advisory only and youâ€™re free to decline any service. What are your opening hours?â€¨Most locations operate daily from morning to evening; 7am to 10 pm. Do you accept walk-ins?â€¨Yes, walk-ins are welcome, but appointments are recommended to plan your time better. What happens during the assessment?â€¨We evaluate your hair or skin and recommend services based on actual needs. Are your products safe for all skin and hair types?â€¨Yes, we use tested global brands suitable for most hair and skin types. How do I book an appointment?â€¨Book online, call the salon, or walk in based on availability.</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:language>
        <rdf:Bag>
          <rdf:li>en</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Bag>
      </dc:language>
      <pdfuaid:part>1</pdfuaid:part>
    </rdf:Description>
